umm, i think the game has three types of bags:
bag of holding
bag of tricks
sack

a sack won't explode if it contains a wand of cancellation.  in the
discussion above substitute bag of holding for sack.  sacks are
immune to curse effects.

a user complained of problems with exploding bags not in your inventory.
the problem has been fixed but not released/distributed.  for now, avoid
exploding your bag of holding if it is on the ground (i.e. not in your
inventory).

